  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of the support to the water sector in Sopot, a polish city siutated on the coast of the Baltic Sea. The city is famous for its beaches. Sopot has recieved support from Sida in 5 phases, in which the last one, renovation of pipe network, is the focus of this evaluation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xE4;rdering av insatser relaterade till VA-systemet i Sopot, &#xD6;stersj&#xF6;stad ber&#xF6;md f&#xF6;r sina vackra str&#xE4;nder. St&#xF6;det till Sopot var upplagt p&#xE5; 5 faser varav den sista, renovering av avloppsledningar, &#xE4;r fokus i denna utv&#xE4;rdering.</narrative>
  </description>
